      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems that vrchat is messing around the player collider when entering/exiting stations. Possible workaround is to permanently attach a trigger to the player and use OnTriggerEnter/Exit instead of the buggy vrc events.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
