  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-01-30T19:58:32.522Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is an older bug that is at least one or two years old, but I couldn't find a Canny about it, so I decided to created one.\n\nThere are multiple issues related to stations and triggers:\n\n- If a player is outside of a trigger, and decides to sit on a station located inside a trigger, then the OnPlayerTriggerEnter event is not fired, it only gets fired after the player leaves the station\n\n- If a player is inside a trigger, and decides to sit on a station located inside a trigger, then the OnPlayerTriggerEnter Event is called a second time.\n\nThose issues make triggers really annoying to use, especially since avatars can also have stations.\n\nI made a world that also showcases that issue : https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_174475ad-6f8e-444d-8b02-67cd13e13b74",
